    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract class for decision probabilities specific to animal interactions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class extends <ref refid="class_decision_probability" kindref="compound">DecisionProbability</ref> to handle probabilities that depend on both predator and prey animals. It manages probability functions indexed by traits and provides a mechanism to apply them. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
